{"counts":{"canonical":20,"context":0,"total":20,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Dholavira: a Harappan City","水管理","城市"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["哈拉帕文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","images":[{"caption":"多拉维拉水管理、排水通道的现存遗迹，2022年摄影。","creator":"Prof Ranga Sai","credit":"Prof Ranga Sai / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AManholes+at+Dholavira+water+management+network.jpg&oldid=1223758466","sha256":"d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Manholes_at_Dholavira_water_management_network.jpg","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-749abc2d3b0a0a310802e810","summary":"多拉维拉属于哈拉帕文明，位于今印度古吉拉特邦干旱的卡迪尔岛地，约在公元前3000至前1500年间有人居住。两条季节性溪流为城市提供稀缺水源，复杂的水管理设施成为理解这里如何维持生活的重要部分，也显示居民必须适应供水具有季节性的环境。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"多拉维拉居民使用复杂水管理系统"},{"aliases":["The Neolithic Settlement of Burzahom","居住建筑","生活史"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7ac51d7f8dec2be8692d30ee","summary":"布尔扎霍姆遗址位于克什米尔地区，约公元前3000至前1000年的序列保存了居住形式的变化。早期居民在天然土中开挖圆形或椭圆形坑室，坑口附近的柱洞，使研究者推测上部曾有遮蔽物。坑内及地面附近的炉址等材料，为理解居住活动提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"布尔扎霍姆群体由坑穴住居转向地面泥砖建筑"},{"aliases":["Emergence of herding in the Upper Yellow River region","畜牧","农业","区域交流"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-03780da0c8f58858f4b272c0","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-03780da0c8f58858f4b272c0","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-45e25f6ddffe761de40d1488","summary":"黄河上游约公元前三千纪中叶至二千纪中叶的生计变化，并非所有社区同时转向同一种牧业。二〇二六年的一项研究汇总五十四处聚落与墓地资料，考察从中亚或蒙古地区传入的家养群居动物，如何被纳入当地原有的农业和生活方式。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2500—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2500},"title":"黄河上游畜牧与猪粟农业的结合"},{"aliases":["Kingdom of Kerma","早期国家"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["努比亚克尔马"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-05f49bff097c6484e3bc0360","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"Nile River","precision":"named_place","role":"source_mentioned_place"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-05f49bff097c6484e3bc0360","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-bfbd3554bb19e569494c9623","summary":"克尔马王国位于尼罗河上游的努比亚地区，以第三瀑布附近的克尔马城得名，教材采用约公元前二四〇〇至一五〇〇年的延续范围。当地居民种植大麦，饲养牛、羊等家畜，村落与都城之间存在贡纳和交换联系，并同埃及及更南方地区开展贸易。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2400年—公元前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-2400},"title":"克尔马王国时期"},{"aliases":["齐家文化","冶金","陶器","玉器"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-59bd3e60d898d5571270ce11","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-59bd3e60d898d5571270ce11","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-9e26070b464d206dbd9a3370","summary":"齐家文化分布于黄河上游，是新石器时代晚期至早期青铜时代的重要考古学文化，以甘肃广河齐家坪遗址得名。黄锦前的介绍采用约公元前二四〇〇至一五〇〇年的宽断代，把特色陶器、玉器系统和冶金技术并列为其显著特征。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2400—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2400},"title":"齐家文化的铜器与玉器"},{"aliases":["Kintampo Tradition","食物生产","聚落","农业"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["金坦波传统"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-dbf9ead376f59ecd8e779d8c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-dbf9ead376f59ecd8e779d8c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8a2e4d70bc600ab8317becab","summary":"金坦波传统是加纳晚期石器时代的一组考古遗存，所引研究把其大致年代放在校正后公元前二一〇〇至一四〇〇年。半定居的村落、食物生产、具象艺术与个人装饰品，是辨识这一传统的重要线索；其活动范围跨越稀树草原与森林环境。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2100—前1400年","end_year":-1400,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-2100},"title":"金坦波群体形成半定居村落并从事食物生产"},{"aliases":["Lower Xiajiadian walled settlements","城墙","聚落","建筑材料"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-d9b5514d71acca6488d46bc4","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d9b5514d71acca6488d46bc4","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-aa2c03119357237eb506e033","summary":"夏家店下层文化主要见于今内蒙古东南部和辽宁西部，通常置于约公元前二〇〇〇至一三〇〇年。相关遗址既有夯土、土坯建筑，也有石砌城墙聚落，建筑材料与聚落形态的差异，为观察这一时期北方社会的变化提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2000—前1300年","end_year":-1300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2000},"title":"夏家店下层文化的土城与石城"},{"aliases":["Oyu Stone Circles","石环","仪式"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-e6cc7b4e0486faa8f0d8e4dd","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-e6cc7b4e0486faa8f0d8e4dd","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-93439007d334d77e8009af1b","summary":"大汤石环位于日本秋田县鹿角市的大汤川沿岸台地，年代约为公元前二〇〇〇至一五〇〇年。遗址由万座和野中堂两组石环组成，直径分别约五十二米和四十四米，以大小不一的河石组合出多种形状，形成醒目的仪式空间。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2000—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-2000},"title":"大汤群体以河石营建仪式石环"},{"aliases":["Vedic Age","历史分期","宗教传统"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ca9294b7753aa283a4226b07","summary":"吠陀时代是南亚历史中的长期阶段，教材采用约公元前一七〇〇至六〇〇年的范围，以吠陀宗教文本得名。相关叙述把这一阶段放在哈拉帕城市衰落之后，关注讲印度雅利安语言的人群迁入旁遮普，并逐渐向恒河流域扩展、同原有居民互动的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700年—公元前600年","end_year":-600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"南亚吠陀时代"},{"aliases":["Poverty Point","土方工程","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cc0b3171b3a9c7079fed921d","summary":"庞蒂岬遗址位于今美国路易斯安那州东北部、密西西比河下游的高地。约公元前一七〇〇至一一〇〇年，当地狩猎、捕鱼和采集人群营建并使用土丘、弧形土垄和中央广场，兼作居住与仪式场所，展现了庞大的集体土方劳动。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700—前1100年","end_year":-1100,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"庞蒂岬群体营建居住与仪式场所"},{"aliases":["Shang Dynasty","文字","早期王朝"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["商"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"商朝","latitude":36.12083333,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":114.325,"note":"本条主体明确记载商代，地图表示该国家或历史政权的关联范围，不表示精确事件发生地点。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"country","role":"材料涉及国家或政权","source_title":"Wikidata Q128938 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q128938&oldid=2523631595"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-fa58a75a60edd579a47732a1","summary":"商代是中国早期王朝史的重要阶段，本条采用约公元前一六〇〇至一〇四六年的概括范围。甲骨文字是认识商代的重要材料，尤其来自安阳附近晚期王都的发掘；这些刻辞使研究者能够把考古遗存同王室活动、祖先祭祀与占卜实践联系起来。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1600年—公元前1046年","end_year":-1046,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1600},"title":"商代与甲骨文字材料"},{"aliases":["Vedas","口传","经典"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["古代南亚吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-9424ac323ccff14a9bcb286a","summary":"吠陀宗教文本的早期形成，主要依靠口头创作与背诵传承。所引教材把这组文本的形成约置于公元前一五〇〇至九〇〇年；其中《梨俱吠陀》收有一千余首献给诸神的赞歌，是研究这一时期语言、宗教和生活的重要材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500年—公元前900年","end_year":-900,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"吠陀文本的口传形成阶段"},{"aliases":["Battle of Megiddo (15th century BC)","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["埃及","迦南"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-5b1c2a806311d74d58d2d0c7","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-5b1c2a806311d74d58d2d0c7","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-e97b46ca5dc469d07ed38c16","summary":"公元前15世纪，图特摩斯三世率埃及军队进攻由卡迭石国王领导的迦南联军，双方在米吉多附近交战。米吉多扼守连接埃及与两河方向的交通路线，具有重要战略价值。据埃及年鉴，法老选择取道阿鲁纳狭谷，路线较直接，却有军队只能单列通过、容易遭受伏击的风险。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前1401年","end_year":-1401,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1500},"title":"图特摩斯三世与迦南联军在米吉多交战"},{"aliases":["Lapita","航海","迁徙"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["拉皮塔文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-52fbdf753d3de83af6df1c85","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-52fbdf753d3de83af6df1c85","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c53ebf1793848d378aad6301","summary":"拉皮塔是考古学家依据特色陶器辨识的一种太平洋古代文化，以新喀里多尼亚的一处遗址得名。约公元前一五〇〇年起，相关人群逐渐向东穿行美拉尼西亚岛屿，约在前一〇〇〇年到达汤加和萨摩亚；这一范围描述的是多代人的海上扩展。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"拉皮塔人群向汤加与萨摩亚扩展"},{"aliases":["Chavin (Archaeological Site)","祭祀建筑","石构工程"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["查文文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-34088c0f4e147299b1e2cc92","summary":"查文遗址坐落在秘鲁安第斯山的高山谷地，并为查文文化命名。这里的台地、广场和石砌建筑构成宗教仪式中心，内部还有廊道、通风设施与排水网络。建筑及石雕中反复出现人形、兽形图像，是理解当地宗教表达的实物线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前300年","end_year":-300,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"查文文化营建石构祭祀建筑"},{"aliases":["Panlongcheng","城市","青铜","区域联系"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-48405d68600789c63656f7d6","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-48405d68600789c63656f7d6","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-af3e6c53cec60311472aad77","summary":"盘龙城位于长江流域，是二里冈文化的一处有城垣聚落，所引论文采用约公元前一五〇〇至一三〇〇年的范围。遗址有夯土城墙、宫殿建筑和高等级墓葬，墓中青铜器、玉器及高温烧制陶器，与北方郑州所见材料有密切联系。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前1300年","end_year":-1300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1500},"title":"盘龙城的城墙聚落"},{"aliases":["Nanguanwai bronze foundry","冶金","作坊","专业分工"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-e1453fba9c1508729e7f0775","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-e1453fba9c1508729e7f0775","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3e0ca38db5729fdb6bb51cdd","summary":"郑州南关外铸铜作坊是认识二里冈时期金属生产的一处遗址。所引研究把其使用阶段放在二里冈下层二期至上层一期，约公元前一五〇〇至一四〇〇年。冶金废料、破碎陶范和坩埚等遗存相互配合，使这里的铸铜作坊性质得到辨识。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前1400年","end_year":-1400,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1500},"title":"郑州南关外铸铜作坊"},{"aliases":["Hatshepsut","贸易","使团"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["埃及第十八王朝"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-b0bf646bd563ea6226e3f55e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b0bf646bd563ea6226e3f55e","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-e27f947ad46a18836e3bac01","summary":"约公元前15世纪，哈特谢普苏特组织使团前往蓬特，后来在德尔巴哈里神庙用大型浮雕纪念远行。考古考察队将这组图像联系到图特摩斯三世在位第九年的使团活动：船队抵达后，由内赫斯率领的埃及人员同蓬特长老及其首领帕雷胡、伊蒂会面。行程与会见由此成为王室纪念建筑中的重要叙事。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1471年","end_year":-1471,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-1471},"title":"哈特谢普苏特资助赴蓬特的使团"}],"revision":"16e2d9bc7dac753e8ae63fc6d7d5464fd2e2ef9bb6dc2e0855171d4b9b35d835","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}